% ============================================================
% references.bib
% Bibliography for the ChemicalQDevice daily funding action packets deposited in
% funding/auto-fund.  Repository v4.8.0.
%
% PROVENANCE.  Thirty entries are carried unchanged from
%   funding/capitalization-plan/final-capital/references.bib
% and the remainder are new here: the FDA approval of Rasonque, the federal
% registration portals a form pack files into, the Treasury reference data a
% capital instruction is cut against, the two site-partner routes, the private
% placement filings, and the two deposited works published after the parent
% bibliography was written.
%
% CONVENTION.  Every entry that has a digital object identifier carries BOTH a
% doi field and a url field pointing at https://doi.org/<doi>, so unsrturl
% renders the identifier as text with a clickable target and no link overflows
% the measure.  Every entry without an identifier carries a url that resolves to
% the document itself and never to a search page.
%
% STYLE.  sections/sec-06 asks for unsrturl rather than unsrt.  Plain unsrt.bst
% reads neither the doi nor the url field, so a reference list built on
% identifiers would print none of them.
% ============================================================

